    "content" : "(i.e., a critical point of (4.1)). Due to this one-one correspondence, all the crucial properties of the energy functional are unchanged, therefore we only analyze the normalized functional moving onward."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
